WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:02.664
Six European giants fit inside India.

00:00:02.679 --> 00:00:03.949
With room left over.

00:00:03.965 --> 00:00:06.355
France, Germany, Spain, Italy,

00:00:06.745 --> 00:00:10.775
the UK and Poland together cover
roughly 2.3 million square kilometres.

00:00:11.095 --> 00:00:13.285
India covers about 3.3 million.

00:00:13.381 --> 00:00:17.571
That leaves around a million square
kilometres free, about the area of Egypt.

00:00:17.671 --> 00:00:20.061
And India has more people
than all of Europe.

00:00:20.157 --> 00:00:21.647
Which country surprised you?

